{"verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"Mwombeni \\nd Bwana\\nd* mvua wakati wa vuli;"},{"verse":2,"text":"Sanamu huzungumza udanganyifu,"},{"verse":3,"text":"“Hasira yangu inawaka dhidi ya wachungaji,"},{"verse":4,"text":"Kutoka Yuda litatokea Jiwe la pembeni,"},{"verse":5,"text":"Kwa pamoja watakuwa kama mashujaa"},{"verse":6,"text":"“Nitaiimarisha nyumba ya Yuda"},{"verse":7,"text":"Waefraimu watakuwa kama mashujaa,"},{"verse":8,"text":"Nitawaashiria na kuwakusanya ndani."},{"verse":9,"text":"Ijapokuwa niliwatawanya miongoni mwa mataifa,"},{"verse":10,"text":"Nitawarudisha kutoka Misri"},{"verse":11,"text":"Watapita katika bahari ya mateso;"},{"verse":12,"text":"Nitawaimarisha katika \\nd Bwana\\nd*,"}]}